 <b><abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.663\">vb.</abbr></b> be inclined, desire, be pleased (Targum Syr.; cf. BH II. <span class=\"hebrew\">צבה</span>);—<b><abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.491\">Pe</abbr>. 1.</b> <i>desire:</i> <i><abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.500\">Pf.</abbr></i> 1 S. <span class=\"hebrew\">צְבִית</span> (<abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.316\">K<sup>§</sup></abbr> 47 Beisp. 1) <i>a)</i> <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.450\">Nö<sup>GGA</sup></abbr>, 1884, 1019 pf. intrans.) <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27007019\" data-end-ref=\"27007019\">Dn 7:19</data> (<abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.380\">c.</abbr> inf.). <b>2.</b> <i>be pleased</i>, <i>will</i> (without hindrance), abs., of God: <i>Impf.</i> 3 ms. <span class=\"hebrew\">יִצְבֵּא</span> <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27004014\" data-end-ref=\"27004014\">4:14</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27004022\" data-end-ref=\"27004022\">4:22</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27004029\" data-end-ref=\"27004029\">4:29</data>; <i>Inf.</i> sf. <span class=\"hebrew\">מִצְבְּיֵהּ</span> v:<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27004032\" data-end-ref=\"27004032\">32</data> acc. to <i>his willing;</i> of <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.442\">Neb</abbr>.: <i>Pt. act.</i> <span class=\"hebrew\">צָבֵא</span> <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27005019\" data-end-ref=\"27005019\">5:19</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27005019\" data-end-ref=\"27005019\">5:19</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27005019\" data-end-ref=\"27005019\">5:19</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27005019\" data-end-ref=\"27005019\">5:19</data></p> <blockquote><p class=\"p\"><abbr>[Str<span class=\"strongs-number\">6640</span>]</abbr> † <span class=\"hebrew\">צְבוּ</span> <b>n.f. thing, anything</b> (orig. <i>purpose</i>) (Palm. <span class=\"hebrew\">צבו</span> <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.401\">Lzb<sup>357</sup></abbr> <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.558\">SAC<sup>100</sup></abbr> <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.116\">Cooke<sup>266</sup></abbr>, Syr. <span class=\"syriac\">ܨܒܘܬܐ</span>, all <i>thing;</i> cf. <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.447\">NH</abbr> <span class=\"hebrew\">חֵפֶץ</span> <i>thing</i>, from <span class=\"hebrew\">הָפֵץ</span> <i>delight in, crave</i>);—<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27006018\" data-end-ref=\"27006018\">Dn 6:18</data>.</p></blockquote>",
