ockquote><p class=\"p\"><abbr>[Str<span class=\"strongs-number\">677,676</span>]</abbr> † [<span class=\"hebrew\">אֶצְבַּע</span>] <b>n.f.</b> <b>1.</b> finger; <b>2.</b> toe (Targum Syr.; BH <i>id.</i>);—<abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.505\">pl.</abbr> <b>1.</b> abs. <span class=\"hebrew\">אֶצְבְּעָן</span> <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27005005\" data-end-ref=\"27005005\">Dn 5:5</data>. <b>2.</b> emph <span class=\"hebrew\">תָָ֯א</span> <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27002041\" data-end-ref=\"27002041\">2:41</data>; cstr. <span class=\"hebrew\">עָ֯</span> v:<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27002042\" data-end-ref=\"27002042\">42</data>.</p></blockquote> <blockquote><p class=\"p\"><abbr>[Str<span class=\"strongs-number\">6655,6654</span>]</abbr> † <span class=\"hebrew\">צַא</span> <b>n.[m.]</b> side (very rare in Aram.; perh. Hebr., v. BH <i>id.,</i> √ <span class=\"hebrew\">צדד</span>);—cstr., <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.380\">c.</abbr> prep.: ´<span class=\"hebrew\">לְח</span>: <span class=\"hebrew\">עליא</span> <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27007025\" data-end-ref=\"27007025\">Dn 7:25</data>, i.e. <i>against;</i> <span class=\"hebrew\">מַלְכוּתָא</span> ´<span class=\"hebrew\">מִצּ</span>: <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27006005\" data-end-ref=\"27006005\">6:5</data>, i.e. <i>arising from, touching</i>.</p></blockquote> <blockquote><p class=\"p\"><abbr>[Str<span class=\"strongs-number\">6656,6658,6660</span>]</abbr> ‡ † <span class=\"hebrew\">צְדָא</span> <b>n.[m.]</b> <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.660\">usu.</abbr> (malicious) purpose (Hebraism form BH <span class=\"hebrew\">צְדִיָּה</span>, √ I. <span class=\"hebrew\">צדה</span>);—<abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.380\">c.</abbr> <span class=\"hebrew\">ה</span> interrog. <span class=\"hebrew\">הַצְדָּא</span> <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27003014\" data-end-ref=\"27003014\">Dn 3:14</data>; &lt; read <span class=\"hebrew\">הַאַוְדָּא</span> <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.59\">Bev</abbr> <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.160\">Dr</abbr> <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.340\">Kmp</abbr>.</p></blockquote> <blockquote><p class=\"p\"><abbr>[Str<span class=\"strongs-number\">6665,6663,6666</span>]</abbr> † <span class=\"hebrew\">צִדְקָה</span> <b>n.f. right doing</b> (<abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.628\">Talm</abbr>., OAram.; v. BH <span class=\"hebrew\">צְדָקָה</span>, √ <span class=\"hebrew\">צדק</span>);—´<span class=\"hebrew\">צ</span>: <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27004024\" data-end-ref=\"27004024\">Dn 4:24</data>.</p></blockquote> <blockquote><p class=\"p\"><abbr>[Str<span class=\"strongs-number\">6676–77</span>]</abbr> † [<span class=\"hebrew\">צַוַּאר</span>] <b>n.m.</b> neck (Targum Syr.; v. BH sub I. <span class=\"hebrew\">צור</span>);—sf. <span class=\"hebrew\">צַוְּארָךְ</span> <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27005016\" data-end-ref=\"27005016\">Dn 5:16</data>, <span class=\"hebrew\">צַוְּארֵהּ</span> v:<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27005007\" data-end-ref=\"27005007\">7</data>, v:<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27005029\" data-end-ref=\"27005029\">29</data>.</p></blockquote>",
