abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.663\">vb.</abbr> Pa.</b> pray (orig. <i>bow</i> in prayer) (Targum <i>id., bow,</i> Pa, <i>pray,</i> so Syr. <span class=\"syriac\">ܨܠܐ</span> and Pa.; <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.17\">As.</abbr> <i>sullû, entreat</i> (appar. not of prayer to gods <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.706\">Zim<sup>KAT</sup></abbr> 3. 610 f.); <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.454\">Ar.</abbr> <span class=\"arabic\">صَلَنا</span> <i>middle of the back</i>, <span class=\"arabic\">صلا</span> II. <i>pray</i>, Eth. <span class=\"ethiopic\">ፀለወ፡</span> <i>bow</i>, <span class=\"ethiopic\">ፀለየ፡</span> <i>pray;</i> <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.556\">Sab.</abbr> <span class=\"hebrew\">צלות</span> <i>shrine</i> <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.256\">Hom<sup>Chr125</sup></abbr>; AA 185);—<i>Pt.</i> <span class=\"hebrew\">מְצַלֵּא</span> <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27006011\" data-end-ref=\"27006011\">Dn 6:11</data> (abs.); <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.505\">pl.</abbr> <span class=\"hebrew\">מְצַלַּ֫יִן</span> (<abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.316\">K<sup>§</sup></abbr> 47a)) <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"15006010\" data-end-ref=\"15006010\">Ezr 6:10</data> (<abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.380\">c.</abbr> <span class=\"hebrew\">ל</span> <i>in behalf of</i>).</p>",
